<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain leaves rate unchanged at 6.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain leaves rate unchanged at 6.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, as expected, said on Tuesday it left its key money rate unchanged at 6.75 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 4.58 trillion pesetas against 4.63 trillion pesetas bid.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
